## ADDITIONAL FEATURE: MULTI-VERTICAL BENCHMARK CONFIGURATION

### WHAT TO BUILD
Add benchmark management to the existing Campaign Diagnostic Agent. Users can:
- Switch between 4 verticals (Legal MVA, Legal Mass Tort, Insurance, Senior Care)
- View all active benchmark thresholds in a collapsible panel
- Manually override any threshold value with a reason
- View change history (who changed what, when, and why)
- Reset thresholds to system defaults for any vertical

### ARCHITECTURE
Use React Context for benchmark state. Benchmarks are defined in a config file as typed objects — NOT scattered constants. The diagnostic engine reads from context, not hardcoded values.

